    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime re-ingestion controller. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Combines a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_workflow_engine" kindref="compound">WorkflowEngine</ref></computeroutput> and an <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_quality_judge" kindref="compound">IngestionQualityJudge</ref></computeroutput> into a feedback loop:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Run the workflow engine on the document.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Evaluate extraction quality.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If quality fails and attempts remain, adjust the step config (based on <computeroutput>report.recommended_steps</computeroutput>) and re-run.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Return the final <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_re_ingestion_controller_1_1_run_result" kindref="compound">RunResult</ref></computeroutput> after quality passes or max attempts.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>NOT thread-safe: use one controller per ingestion worker thread.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_re_ingestion_controller_1a67b96563a0b5fe9437ee27d99d03477d" kindref="member">ReIngestionController</ref><sp/>ctrl(workflow_engine,<sp/>judge);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctrl.addObserver(my_monitor);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>res<sp/>=<sp/>ctrl.process(manifest);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!res.quality_met)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>log(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Document<sp/>{}<sp/>did<sp/>not<sp/>reach<sp/>quality<sp/>threshold<sp/>after<sp/>{}<sp/>attempts&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>manifest.source_uri,<sp/>res.attempts);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
